---
---
<section class="section">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="section-head reveal">
      <div>
        <span class="eyebrow"><span class="num">05</span> <span class="bar"></span> Roadmap</span>
      </div>
      <div>
        <h2>What's coming to the kit.</h2>
        <p class="lede">The MVP earns its place. These build on top of it — same chat, more superpowers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>

    <div class="soon-grid stagger reveal">
      <div class="soon-card">
        <span class="soon-badge">Soon</span>
        <div class="soon-num">
          <span>05 / Photo</span>
          <span class="glyph">◧</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Food photo recognition</h3>
        <p>Snap your plate. Get your macros. No barcode hunting, no database scrolling.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="soon-card">
        <span class="soon-badge">Soon</span>
        <div class="soon-num">
          <span>06 / Voice</span>
          <span class="glyph">◔</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Voice logging</h3>
        <p>Talk faster than you type. Voice memo in, structured log out. Built for the morning rush.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="soon-card">
        <span class="soon-badge">Soon</span>
        <div class="soon-num">
          <span>07 / Weekly recap</span>
          <span class="glyph">▦</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Sunday recap</h3>
        <p>Every Sunday, a short woven report — calories logged, top spend categories, your week vs your goals. Delivered in chat. No tabs.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="soon-card">
        <span class="soon-badge">Soon</span>
        <div class="soon-num">
          <span>08 / Dashboard</span>
          <span class="glyph">◱</span>
        </div>
        <h3>Dashboard</h3>
        <p>Your data, visualised. A web view for the weeks you want to look at the numbers.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</section>

<style>
  .soon-grid {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr;
    gap: 0;
    border-top: 1px solid var(--hair);
    border-left: 1px solid var(--hair);
  }
  @media (max-width: 720px) { .soon-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .soon-card {
    position: relative;
    padding: 36px 32px;
    border-right: 1px solid var(--hair);
    border-bottom: 1px solid var(--hair);
    background: var(--paper);
    transition: background .2s ease;
  }
  .soon-card:hover { background: var(--paper-2); }

  .soon-badge {
    position: absolute;
    top: 24px;
    right: 24px;
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 10px;
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    text-transform: uppercase;
    color: var(--muted-2);
    padding: 4px 10px;
    background: var(--paper-2);
    border: 1px solid var(--hair);
    border-radius: 999px;
  }
  .soon-num {
    font-family: 'JetBrains Mono', monospace;
    font-size: 11px;
    color: var(--muted-2);
    letter-spacing: 0.16em;
    margin-bottom: 18px;
    display: flex;
    justify-content: space-between;
    align-items: center;
  }
  .soon-num .glyph {
    width: 28px;
    height: 28px;
    border: 1px solid var(--hair-2);
    border-radius: 8px;
    display: grid;
    place-items: center;
    color: var(--ink);
    font-size: 14px;
  }
  .soon-card h3 { margin-bottom: 8px; }
  .soon-card p { font-size: 15px; }
</style>
